        "runmode.settings.haptics.general.advanced.latency.tooltip": "Target output buffer size for the haptic audio device, in milliseconds. Larger values guard against dropouts and glitches on slower systems but add delay between the simulation and the felt effect; smaller values tighten responsiveness at the risk of underruns. Leave at 0 to use the device's default latency.",
